  "description": "Unleash the energetic spirit of city streets with Graff Tales, a daring graffiti font. It showcases characteristic small breaks within every letter, bringing about an aura of bona fide street art. Graff Tales’ sturdy strokes and genuine representation encapsulates the edgy, unfiltered vibe of urban graffiti to your fingertips. Its distinct style is befitting for impactful branding, striking posters, vibrant album covers and any other creative pursuit that necessitates a pure graffiti aesthetic.\nEmploy Graff Tales in your designs for a fearless statement that naturally differentiates itself. Experience the rhythm of the streets in each letter and accentuate the authenticity in your masterpieces.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Unleash the energetic spirit of city streets with Graff Tales, a daring graffiti font. It showcases characteristic small breaks within every letter, bringing about an aura of bona fide street art. Graff Tales’ sturdy strokes and genuine representation encapsulates the edgy, unfiltered vibe of urban graffiti to your fingertips. Its distinct style is befitting for impactful branding, striking posters, vibrant album covers and any other creative pursuit that necessitates a pure graffiti aesthetic.<br>\nEmploy Graff Tales in your designs for a fearless statement that naturally differentiates itself. Experience the rhythm of the streets in each letter and accentuate the authenticity in your masterpieces.</p>",
